Lately I discovered, that xjewel-1.6 (which is the newest one, as far as
I know) don't recognize a triplet in the upper left corner placed like this:

 _____
|  *
| *
|*
|

The bug is easy to fix. All there s to do is to alter the following in
logig.c:

	/* Check Diagonal Right */
	k=NUM_COLS-2;
to
	k=NUM_COLS-3;

(This is not really the bug, but the same wrong idea. It starts checking
a Diagonal, which is only two pieces long)

	/* Check Diagonal Left */
	k=3;
to
	k=2;

